ii. Maintenance:<br /><br />
a) Planned/unplanned maintenance and<br /><br />
inspections of gas handling system(s) and<br /><br />
related processes, and construction activities.<br /><br />
b) Scheduled unloading or cleaning of a well or<br /><br />
