testing, other well-evaluation testing or the<br /><br />
necessary blow down to perform these<br /><br />
procedures, and maintenance required during<br /><br />
and after an emergency shutdown or restart.<br /><br />
iii. Restart: the act of resuming production following<br /><br />
a shutdown event.<br /><br />
