with the Petroleum Agreement and any applicable Lifting<br /><br />
Agreement, and royalty shall be payable thereon. The realised<br /><br />
price of such Petroleum shall not be used in determining the<br /><br />
reference price under Article 13 of the Petroleum Agreement.<br /><br />
