that are generally accepted in the international oil and gas<br /><br />
industry as being state-of-the-art or otherwise appropriate to<br /><br />
the operations in question, safe, economical, environmentally<br /><br />
sound and efficient in developing, producing, processing and<br /><br />
transporting petroleum. Accordingly, the Licence does not<br /><br />
limit nor in any manner restrict the right and authority of the<br /><br />
State to impose taxes or enact and enforce legislative,<br /><br />
regulatory or other statutory instruments in respect of specific<br /><br />
or general aspects of petroleum operations and activities or<br /><br />
otherwise.<br /><br />
(iii)<br /><br />
This Licence does not exempt the Licence Holder from<br /><br />
obtaining other licences, permits and approvals which are<br /><br />
necessary according to the Act or other applicable laws in<br /><br />
effect at any given time.<br /><br />
